    "description": "Alipore Zoological Gardens is a zoo in West Bengal, located in Kolkata. It was established in 1876 as a captive-wildlife and conservation-education facility. The zoo is home to the Royal Bengal Tiger among its resident wildlife. Other notable species also housed here include Sambar Deer, Lion-tailed Macaque, Asiatic Lion, House Crow, and Common Myna."
